    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Courtyard Homes\r\nComfortable one and two-bed homes with easy living in mind\r\n\r\nOur courtyard homes combine modern design with efficient layouts, creating bright and comfortable spaces ideal for independent living. Homes can be tailored with personalised interior finishes to suit your taste and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n • 1 and 2 bed options, 70–103 sq m\r\n • Air to Water Heat Pump System\r\n • High-performance uPVC windows and doors\r\n • A2 rated timber frame with block outer construction\r\n • Custom fitted kitchens\r\n • Stylish bathroom tiling and sanitary fittings\r\n • Designed for modern later living"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A"
      }
